{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/pompomon/soulcard/pull/31","repo":"pompomon/soulcard","number":31,"set":"agent","source":"copilot-agent","title":"Add configurable turn burning and 2-over-Ace clash rules","body":"Adds a persisted Turn burning preference for new/restarted games and changes clash ordering so 2 beats Ace. Gameplay semantics move to rules v2 while save schema and event versions remain unchanged.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **Clash rules**\n  - Centralized card comparison across settlement, event validation, and presentation.\n  - Added the 2-over-Ace exception without changing card values or deck order.\n\n```js\ncompareCards('c-2S', 'c-AS') > 0\ncompareCards('c-2S', 'c-3S') < 0\n```\n\n- **Turn burning**\n  - Added a default-on Gameplay setting persisted independently.\n  - Added burn-on and no-burn v2 rulesets.\n  - Applied the preference to Start and Restart; Resume preserves the saved ruleset.\n\n- **Compatibility**\n  - Incremented `gameRulesVersion` to 2.\n  - Routed rules-v1 saves through incompatible-save recovery.\n  - Updated deterministic fixtures, fingerprints, migrations, and simulation outcomes.\n\n- **Documentation**\n  - Documented comparison semantics, setting lifecycle, and save compatibility.\n  - Added and synchronized the gameplay-improvements milestone.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Node 24: `npm test`, `npm run build`\n- Headless browser: Burn Off persisted across reload and produced a no-burn saved match\n- Secret scan and CodeQL completed with no findings","authorType":"Bot","additions":1609,"deletions":158,"changedFiles":44,"files":[{"path":".github/skills/soulcard-code-review/SKILL.md","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"README.md","additions":12,"deletions":5},{"path":"docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md","additions":98,"deletions":51},{"path":"docs/MILESTONES.md","additions":6,"deletions":5},{"path":"src/app/bootstrap.js","additions":5,"deletions":1},{"path":"src/app/new-match.js","additions":5,"deletions":2},{"path":"src/app/settings.js"